|                        |          | $\pip$ | $label$                                                 | block labels             |            |
| Statements             | $stmt$   | $::=$  | $x <- v; stmt$                                          | literals / constants     | `CONST_`*  |
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $\many{x_i} <- primitive f(\many{x_j}); stmt$           | primitive calls          | `PRIM_OP`  |
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $x <- here; stmt \pip x <- there; stmt$                 | evidence zero / one      | `CONST_INT`|
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $x_1 <- x_2 \oplus x_3; stmt$                           | evidence composition     | `ADD`      |
|                        |          ||| __jumps:__
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $jump B$                                                | jump                     | `JUMP`     |
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $if x_1 then B(\many{x_i}) else stmt$                   | conditional jump         | `IFZERO`   |
|                        |          ||| __stack management:__
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $push B (\many{x_i}); stmt$                             | push a frame             | `PUSH`     |
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $return (\many{x_i})$                                   | return                   | `RETURN`   |
|                        |          ||| __metastack management:__
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $x_1 <- shift x_2; stmt$                                | capturing stacks         | `SHIFT_DYN`|
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $x <- shift v; stmt$                                    | capturing stacks         | `SHIFT`|
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $x <- new stack B(\many{x_i}); stmt$                    | creating new stacks      | `NEW_STACK`|
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $push stack x; stmt$                                    | pushing a stack          | `PUSH_STACK`|
|                        |          ||| __codata:__
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $x <- new V(\many{x_j}); stmt$                          | object creation          | `NEW`      |
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $x.m(\many{x_i})$                                       | method invocation        | `INVOKE`   |
|                        |          ||| __data:__
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $x <- tag(\many{x_i}); stmt$                            | data construction        | `CONSTRUCT`|
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $x match \{\many{tag(\many{x_i}) => B}\}$               | matching                 | `MATCH`    |
|                        |          ||| __register management:__
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $x_1 <- x_2; stmt$                                      | copying                  | `COPY`     |
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $x_1 \leftrightarrow x_2; stmt$                         | swapping                 | `SWAP`     |
|                        |          | $\pip$ | $drop x; stmt$                                          | dropping                 | `DROP`     |
| VTables                | $V$      | $::=$  | $\{\many{m_i \mapsto B_i}\}$                            | virtual table            | `VTable`
